<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady-up $1 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady-up $1 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $1.00 per cwt higher, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 73.00-78.50, pkg black 650 lbs 83.00; 800- 900 lbs 64.95-68.75.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 66.00-73.60; 700-800 lbs 64.00-67.50. Medium and Large 2 400-500 lbs 68.00-70.50.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 900</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
